ult (ordering consistency)\n- Whether the L2 cache benefit claim is realistic given the NTT's butterfly access pattern"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01J1PSSGwTrH8SjJVxPqzM2B","session_id":"b4e113b8-a396-45cc-8e86-654a475f0e59","uuid":"ce0c57c3-7a21-41ff-9427-afdc31da7c75","timestamp":"2026-04-16T13:25:58.755Z"}
