previous: -47ms, 1.04x lower).\nautoopt-results/2026-04-14-1200-bulk-alloc-mle-fold-buffers/plan.md:50:Quantitative estimate from nsight: the fold accounts for ~(37K/47K) × 38ms allocs + ~(37K/49K) × 21ms frees ≈ 31ms + 16ms = **~47ms** of pure CUDA memory API overhead. Additional savings from reduced memory pool fragmentation bring the total to ~40–55ms.\nautoopt-results/2026-04-15-0100-batch-global-gkr-input-eval/report.md:39:| STARK excl trace (APC 0) | 2153ms | 2147ms | 2160ms | -7ms, 1.00x | +13ms, 1.01x |\nautoopt-results/2026-04-13-2035-gkr-input-round-robin/report.md:33:| Trace Commit | 406ms | 247ms | 254ms | -152ms (1.60x lower) | +7ms (noise) |\nautoopt-results/2026-04-13-prealloc-round0-buffers/report.md:27:| **Round 0 APC 300** | 662ms | 296ms | 443ms | 219ms lower (1.49x) | 147ms higher (1.50x) |\nautoopt-results/2026-04-13-1430-batch-mle-main-ptrs-upload/report.md:50:| STARK excl trace | 2153ms | 2147ms | 2150ms | -3ms, 1.00x | +3ms, 1.00x (noise) |\nautoopt-results/2026-04-13-1100-batch-mle-interpolation/report.md:68:| Trace Commit | 406ms | 247ms | 250ms | -156ms, 1.62x lower | +3ms, 1.01x higher |\nautoopt-results/2026-04-14-0730-overlap-logup-precompute-round0/report.md:38:| Trace Commit | 406ms | 247ms | 247ms | -159ms, 1.64x lower | 0ms, unchanged |\nautoopt-results/2026-04-13-1700-batch-round0-caller-routing/plan.md:50:- `logup_round0.cu`: `logup_r0_ntt_eval_interactions_coset_parallel_kernel` — 735 instances (396 `<true>` + 339 `<false>`), 247ms total\n\n[Showing results with pagination = limit: 20]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01J1PSSGwTrH8SjJVxPqzM2B","session_id":"b4e113b8-a396-45cc-8e86-654a475f0e59","uuid":"82e38a74-392f-4e50-9f00-50561c522085","timestamp":"2026-04-16T13:27:08.661Z"}
